{"dur":56.5,"ev":[{"t":0.5,"type":"beam"},{"t":1,"type":"voice","id":"L1"},{"t":1,"type":"sub","t1":5.0809999999999995,"text":"This window only tells its story where the sun falls."},{"t":2.5,"type":"tink","v":0.5},{"t":5.4,"type":"title"},{"t":10,"type":"voice","id":"L2"},{"t":10,"type":"sub","t1":14.389999999999999,"text":"At dawn, a knight was sent to slay the dragon that ate the sun."},{"t":10.6,"type":"tink","v":0.5},{"t":11.1,"type":"tink","v":0.8},{"t":15.6,"type":"move","d":1.6},{"t":17.2,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":17.575,"type":"step","v":0.5},{"t":17.8,"type":"voice","id":"L3"},{"t":17.8,"type":"sub","t1":21.747000000000003,"text":"He crossed the hills and rivers in the white noon light."},{"t":17.95,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":18.325,"type":"step","v":0.5},{"t":18.7,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":19.075,"type":"step","v":0.5},{"t":19.45,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":19.825,"type":"step","v":0.5},{"t":20,"type":"wings"},{"t":20.2,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":20.575,"type":"step","v":0.5},{"t":20.95,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":21,"type":"wings"},{"t":21.325,"type":"step","v":0.5},{"t":21.7,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":22.075,"type":"step","v":0.5},{"t":22.45,"type":"step","v":0.8},{"t":22.6,"type":"move","d":0.8},{"t":24.4,"type":"voice","id":"L4"},{"t":24.4,"type":"sub","t1":28.185,"text":"All afternoon they fought, and the shadows grew longer."},{"t":24.75,"type":"clash"},{"t":26.25,"type":"clash"},{"t":27.75,"type":"clash"},{"t":29.25,"type":"clash"},{"t":29.95,"type":"move","d":0.4},{"t":30.25,"type":"creak"},{"t":31.8,"type":"crack"},{"t":32.6,"type":"ignite"},{"t":33,"type":"grind","d":1.3},{"t":33.8,"type":"voice","id":"L5"},{"t":33.8,"type":"sub","t1":38,"text":"Then, in the red of evening, he saw what the dragon was guarding."},{"t":38.3,"type":"voice","id":"L6"},{"t":38.3,"type":"sub","t1":42.266,"text":"The last ember of the sun, kept warm until morning."},{"t":41.25,"type":"slide","d":0.5},{"t":41.75,"type":"weld","i":0},{"t":42,"type":"slide","d":0.5},{"t":42.5,"type":"weld","i":1},{"t":42.75,"type":"slide","d":0.5},{"t":43.25,"type":"weld","i":2},{"t":43.5,"type":"slide","d":0.5},{"t":44,"type":"weld","i":3},{"t":44.1,"type":"slide","d":0.5},{"t":44.6,"type":"bell","i":4},{"t":45,"type":"voice","id":"L7"},{"t":45,"type":"sub","t1":47.817,"text":"So the knight laid down his sword."},{"t":47.4,"type":"dusk"},{"t":49.2,"type":"voice","id":"L8"},{"t":49.2,"type":"sub","t1":53.493,"text":"And every night since, one pane of glass keeps its own light."},{"t":52.9,"type":"endcard"},{"t":54.8,"type":"dawnwink"}]}